ine\"},\"wrapper\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"#ffffff\"},\"body\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"#008282\"}}}', 'https://ps.w.org/mailpoet/assets/newsletter-templates/retro_computing_magazine/thumbnail.20190411-1500.jpg', NULL, 1, NULL, '2026-10-09 15:15:19'),
